      "block_preview_text": "Note that the safety and quality of the final juice is dependent on the safety and quality of the raw material. Identify that raw materials can include fruits and vegetables and various types of water and additives throughout the process. Indicate how the environment, both in and around growing fields and packing houses, can influence the safety and quality of raw materials. Mention that microbial contamination of produce can occur at any point during its production.",
